# ConditionGame core rules

Read `AGENTS.md` for the full working agreement. Non-negotiables:

1. Postgres only. No SQLite, including tests. pgvector is available.
2. One Laravel + Inertia + React app. No second API service.
3. Every game capability is a tool first (`app/Game/Tools`), registered in `AppServiceProvider`.
4. Server is authoritative for HP, damage, loot, and conditions.
5. Sage never invents data; it reads through tools.
6. Docker only: `./dev.sh up|down|test|check|smoke|fresh`.
7. Prove it: behavior change ships with a test, eval, or smoke check. `./dev.sh check` green.

When the owner is vague or non-technical, use `.claude/skills/discovery/SKILL.md`: restate,
ask at most five questions, offer at most three options, confirm the slice, then build.

Report honestly: what changed, what you verified, what you did not.
